"name":"m𝓓","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"IdentAlg 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓"},{"explicit":false,"name":"Θ","role":"type","type":"Type u_7"},{"explicit":false,"name":"env","role":"variable","type":"Θ → Environment 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"bad","role":"type","type":"Θ → 𝓓 → Prop"},{"explicit":false,"name":"δ","role":"variable","type":"ℝ"},{"explicit":true,"name":"hbad","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (θ : Θ), MeasurableSet {d | bad θ d}"},{"explicit":true,"name":"h","role":"hypothesis","type":"∀ (θ : Θ) {Ω : Type (max u v w z)} {_mΩ : MeasurableSpace Ω} (P : MeasureTheory.Measure Ω)\n  [inst : MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure P] (O : ℕ → Ω → 𝓞) (X : ℕ → Ω → 𝓐) (Y : ℕ → Ω → 𝓨)\n  (out : Ω → 𝓓), A.IsRun (env θ) O X Y out P → P.real {ω | bad θ (out ω)} ≤ δ"}],"conclusion":"A.IsPAC env bad δ","decl":"Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC.of_forall_isRun"},"code":"/-- **PAC from a bound on every run.** To prove that `A` is PAC at level `δ` it suffices to\nbound by `δ` the probability of a bad output for every run of `A` on a probability space in the\nuniverse of the canonical run `runMeasure` (the converse, for runs in any universe, is\n`IsPAC.measureReal_bad_of_isRun`). -/\nlemma IsPAC.of_forall_isRun {𝓞 : Type u} {𝓐 : Type v} {𝓨 : Type w} {𝓓 : Type z}\n    {m𝓞 : MeasurableSpace 𝓞} {m𝓐 : MeasurableSpace 𝓐} {m𝓨 : MeasurableSpace 𝓨}\n    {m𝓓 : MeasurableSpace 𝓓} {A : IdentAlg 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓} {Θ : Type*} {env : Θ → Environment 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨}\n    {bad : Θ → 𝓓 → Prop} {δ : ℝ} (hbad : ∀ θ, MeasurableSet {d | bad θ d})\n    (h : ∀ θ, ∀ {Ω : Type (max u v w z)} {_mΩ : MeasurableSpace Ω} (P : Measure Ω)\n      [IsProbabilityMeasure P] (O : ℕ → Ω → 𝓞) (X : ℕ → Ω → 𝓐) (Y : ℕ → Ω → 𝓨) (out : Ω → 𝓓),\n      A.IsRun (env θ) O X Y out P → P.real {ω | bad θ (out ω)} ≤ δ) :\n    A.IsPAC env bad δ","proof":":= by\n  intro θ\n  have hrun := A.isRun_runMeasure (env θ)\n  rw [← hrun.hasLaw_output.measureReal_eq (hbad θ)]\n  exact h θ _ _ _ _ _ hrun","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/Run.lean","start":111,"end":126,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/Run.lean#L111-L126"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["LE.le","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsPAC","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["MeasurableSet","mathlib","definition"],["MeasurableSpace","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","class"],["MeasureTheory.IsZeroOrProbabilityMeasure.toIsFiniteMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["MeasureTheory.Measure","mathlib","structure"],["MeasureTheory.Measure.real","mathlib","definition"],["MeasureTheory.instIsZeroOrProbabilityMeasureOfIsProbabilityMeasure","mathlib","instance"],["Nat","lean4","inductive"],["Real","mathlib","structure"],["Real.instLE","mathlib","instance"],["Set.ofPred","mathlib","definition"]],"users":[],"sorry":false,"ownSorry":false,"sorryVia":[],"axioms":[],"change":null,"reviews":[],"claim":null,"specifies":[],"specifiedBy":[],"characterizations":[],"pulled":false,"provenance":null,"edited":{"commit":"f1a92e33571fde49fce6355928bb1a73476e5a39","date":"2026-09-13"}},{"id":268,"name":"Learning.IdentAlg.isRun_runMeasure","kind":"Lemma","keyword":"lemma","module":"Maiti2026Power.LeanMachineLearning.Run","package":"Maiti2026Power","isProp":true,"hashes":{"meaning":"7a2b93f0e8eabeba","local":"a2f849219ccb0a87","content":"44ca4141ac1d123f"},"doc":"Every identification algorithm has a run in every environment: the canonical run on\n`runMeasure`. ","statement":{"binders":[{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓞","role":"type","type":"Type u_1"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓐","role":"type","type":"Type u_2"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓨","role":"type","type":"Type u_3"},{"explicit":false,"name":"𝓓","role":"type","type":"Type u_4"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓞","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓞"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓐","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓐"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓨","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓨"},{"explicit":false,"name":"m𝓓","role":"instance","type":"MeasurableSpace 𝓓"},{"explicit":true,"name":"A","role":"variable","type":"IdentAlg 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨 𝓓"},{"explicit":true,"name":"env","role":"variable","type":"Environment 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨"}],"conclusion":"A.IsRun env (fun n ω => IT.obs n ω.1) (fun n ω => IT.action n ω.1) (fun n ω => IT.feedback n ω.1)\n  Prod.snd (A.runMeasure env)","decl":"Learning.IdentAlg.isRun_runMeasure"},"code":"/-- Every identification algorithm has a run in every environment: the canonical run on\n`runMeasure`. -/\nlemma isRun_runMeasure :\n    A.IsRun env (fun n ω ↦ IT.obs n ω.1) (fun n ω ↦ IT.action n ω.1) (fun n ω ↦ IT.feedback n ω.1)\n      Prod.snd (A.runMeasure env)","proof":"where\n  isAlgEnvSeq := (IT.isAlgEnvSeq_trajMeasure A.alg env).comp_hasLaw\n    ⟨measurable_fst.aemeasurable, Measure.fst_compProd _ _⟩ measurable_fst\n  hasCondDistrib_output :=\n    hasCondDistrib_snd_compProd_comap (trajMeasure A.alg env) A.output\n      A.measurable_stoppedHist_traj fun _ ↦ inferInstance","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/Run.lean","start":94,"end":103,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/Run.lean#L94-L103"},"deps":[263,270],"outside":[],"external":[["Fin","lean4","structure"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IT.action","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IT.feedback","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IT.obs","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.IdentAlg","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.IsRun","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.IdentAlg.alg","LeanMac